    "title": "Hat Trick: Rancher Hat Bar brings a custom experience to Baton Rouge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Riley Bienvenu Bourgeois ,\n16 hours ago A new shopping experience has opened in Acadian Village, giving customers the chance to fully customize hats to fit their personal style. Beginning with a cowboy, rancher or trucker hat in a range of colors and styles, shoppers can burn or brand the hat of their choice and add accessories like charms, cards, feathers and more, making a unique piece you won’t find anywhere else. Read full article\n1",
